senses.gloss:
(II)--(Samiti) a कृतलोक, the first world; first was said भू and then came this world;
1: वा. २३. १०७; २४. १८. १०१. ११, ३५-36.
is पार्थिव loka;
2: Ib. १०१. १८.
these lokas are burnt by the flames of the seven suns;
3: Ib. १०१. २०.
मरीचि, कश्यप, दक्ष and other प्रजापतिस् live here;
4: Ib. १०१. ३४.
people here live on rice and juice.
5: Ib. १०१. ४०, ४२.
